    "text": {
     "zh": "坐姿腘绳肌前伸",
     "en": "Seated hamstring stretch"
    },
    "ms": {
     "zh": 1811,
     "en": 1440
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "intro",
    "role": "intro",
    "text": {
     "zh": "坐姿腘绳肌前伸，拉伸大腿后侧",
     "en": "Seated hamstring stretch. Stretches the hamstrings."
    },
    "ms": {
     "zh": 3111,
     "en": 3646
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "cue1",
    "role": "cue",
    "text": {
     "zh": "坐椅前缘，一腿伸直",
     "en": "Sit on the front edge of the chair, one leg straight"
    },
    "ms": {
     "zh": 1997,
     "en": 2763
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "cue2",
    "role": "cue",
    "text": {
     "zh": "腿伸直，脚尖勾起，背挺直往前",
     "en": "Leg straight, toes up, lean forward with a straight back"
    },
    "ms": {
     "zh": 3158,
     "en": 3181
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "cue3",
    "role": "cue",
    "text": {
     "zh": "背挺直前倾，大腿后侧拉长",
     "en": "Lean forward with a straight back, feel the hamstrings lengthen"
    },
    "ms": {
     "zh": 2694,
     "en": 3158
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "side_switch",
    "role": "side_switch",
    "text": {
     "zh": "左侧同样，腿伸直，脚尖勾起，背挺直往前",
     "en": "Now the left side. Leg straight, toes up, lean forward with a straight back"
    },
    "ms": {
     "zh": 4272,
     "en": 5108
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "rest",
    "role": "rest",
    "text": {
     "zh": "放松一下。下一组记住，背挺直前倾，大腿后侧拉长",
     "en": "Relax for a moment. Next set, remember: Lean forward with a straight back, feel the hamstrings lengthen"
    },
    "ms": {
     "zh": 5178,
     "en": 6780
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "finish",
    "role": "finish",
    "text": {
     "zh": "坐姿腘绳肌前伸，完成",
     "en": "Seated hamstring stretch, done."
    },
